[00:00.00]Oh no! The pumpkin is rolling!|哎呀！南瓜滚起来啦！
[00:03.20]Quick! Let's catch it!|快！我们抓住它！
[00:07.00]Stop, pumpkin! It's too fast!|停下，南瓜！太快啦！
[00:14.22]Move, little chickens!|让开，小鸡们！
[00:16.72]Be careful, sweetie!|小心点，宝贝！
[00:19.12]It's still rolling!|它还在滚！
[00:21.88]Whoa!|哇哦！
[00:23.98]Look! It's stuck in the hay!|你看！它卡在干草里了！
[00:26.42]We found it! It's so heavy!|找到它了！好重呀！
[00:33.48]Let me help you.|我来帮你。
[00:35.64]One, two, three, pull!|一、二、三，拉！
[00:40.92]Wow! So many seeds!|哇！好多籽呀！
[00:44.34]Let's scoop them out.|我们把它们掏出来吧。
[00:49.14]We can plant them next spring!|明年春天我们可以把它们种下去！
[00:56.42]The pumpkin cake is so yummy.|南瓜蛋糕真好吃。
[00:59.82]For you, Grandma.|给你的，奶奶。
[01:04.04]Thank you, my sweet girl.|谢谢你，我的乖孩子。
